<title>INDIA: Hindalco hikes stake in Indian Rayon.</title>
<headline>Hindalco hikes stake in Indian Rayon.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private aluminium maker Hindalco Industries on Wednesday told the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) it had acquired 2.2 million shares in group firm Indian Rayon.  </p>
<p>Hindalco's total holding in Indian Rayon was 3.9 million shares after the latest acquisition, the BSE said in a notice to its members. It said this represented around 8.7 percent of the paid up capital of Indian Rayon.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
